{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ef411414-e147-82b3-bfc5-2250e96f15b4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:06:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:03:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I'm calling about a storm drain, or a grate really, at the curb in front of 146 Ayrault Street. Up in Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:03:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "146 Ayrault Street. Okay, and what's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:03:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The grate has sunk. It's down lower than the pavement around it, so when it rains the water goes everywhere except down it. It pools out into the street and across the sidewalk. We had that nor'easter that ended Saturday, two days ago, and it's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:03:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still sitting there today, Monday. And the grate itself sank, so it's lower than the road around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:03:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Well, how do I know it's the grate and not the pipe underneath? I don't. I just know the water runs around it. It goes right past it like it isn't there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:04:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Either way a crew would have to go look at it. I'll write it up as a sunken grate with water pooling and not draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:04:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And that goes to who, exactly? Because I feel like I've said things to this city before and they just vanish."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:04:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes onto the Public Works work list for the drain crews. I'm entering it now with the address, 146 Ayrault Street. I can't promise you a day, they're busy after a storm like that, but it'll be in front of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:04:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm. So no day. Okay. Here's my concern, though. There are kids who walk through there to get to the bus, and people walk their dogs along that block. That water gets wide, and you can't tell how deep it is at the edge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:04:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that there's foot traffic, kids and dog walkers, near the water, so they know it's a safety concern and not just a nuisance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:05:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And honestly, it's bugging me at the shop too. I run a business out of the front of the building, and I've been rearranging furniture all morning. I've moved the couch twice now, away from the door, in case it comes in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:05:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no. Has any water actually gotten inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:05:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. That's why I'm moving things. But how do I know it won't next time? Nobody's done anything about that grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me read back what I have. 146 Ayrault Street, Historic Hill, a sunken grate at the curb, water going around it instead of down, pooling onto the sidewalk since the storm, with kids and dog walkers passing by. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Can you also put down that I want a call back when it's done? Not just when somebody looks at it, when it's actually fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:05:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a request for a call back once the work is complete. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:06:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162. Sheila Flynn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sheila Flynn, 401-555-0162. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. And you're sure that's saved? You'll see it on your end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:06:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the system now, I'm looking at it. You'll have a request on file under your name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:06:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. I'll be watching that corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:06:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Sheila. Take care."
    }
  ],
